<title>USA: Saf-T-Lok names Broderick president/CEO.</title>
<headline>Saf-T-Lok names Broderick president/CEO.</headline>
<dateline>TEQUESTA, Fla. 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saf-T-Lok Inc, which makes handgun locks, said it named Lisa Broderick president and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Broderick replaces Robert Gilbert, who will now serve as vice chairman, the company said.</p>
<p>Broderick most recently served as chief executive of Honicorp Inc, an Internet software company.</p>
<p>During her tenure with Saf-T-Lok, Broderick will continue to serve as managing director of American Capital Partners, a merchant banking firm she founded.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
